# ==============================================================================
# Cloudflare Pages Redirects & Reverse Proxy
# ==============================================================================
# 1. API Reverse Proxy: Forwards all frontend /api/* calls to your Render backend.
#    Replace 'YOUR_RENDER_BACKEND_URL' with your real Render URL
#    (e.g., https://uniora-backend.onrender.com)
/api/*  https://YOUR_RENDER_BACKEND_URL/api/:splat  200

# 2. Root Redirect: Sends visitors landing on the homepage to the dashboard
/  /dashboard/index.html  302
